
# Runtime state of any demo/test workspace, never source
**/.agent/

# Node dependencies and generated coverage are restored/recomputed locally.
**/node_modules/
**/coverage/

# Ruflo local secrets and runtime data
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.claude-flow/data/
.claude-flow/logs/
.claude-flow/sessions/

# ruflo/claude-flow tool state
**/.claude-flow/
# Runtime state of a workspace, never source
/.agent/
**/.semantic-engine/

# The event store is derived state, regenerable from sessions via
# `npm run backfill:eventstore`; it is never committed.
**/.agent/eventstore/

# scratch: pristine HEAD copies and throwaway repros used by the audit
# workflow (see FIX-PLAN-REVIEW-FINDINGS.md, section 10) - never commit
/tmp-baseline/
